        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Complete sewer system, DN 300, SN 4-8, profile 1 according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. PVC-pipe, ID 291-296 mm, outer diameter 315 mm, wall thickness 9-11 mm, 12-15 kg/m, 910-1400 kg/m³.\n\n# Included processes\nThis process models 1 meter of sewer system infrastructure with PVC-pipe, DN 300, SN 4-8, profile 1 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the production phase (A1–A3), the construction phase/ transport (A4–A5) as well as deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for one meter of sewer system with PVC-pipe.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
